570	            <h2>Key Features</h2>
571	            <p>
572	                This template includes semantic HTML elements, responsive design, modern CSS with gradients,
573	                proper meta tags for SEO, and accessibility considerations to create a solid foundation for any web project.
574	            </p>
575	            <ul class="feature-list">
576	                <li>Semantic HTML5 structure</li>
577	                <li>WCAG 2.1 accessibility compliance</li>
578	                <li>Mobile-first responsive design</li>
579	                <li>Keyboard navigation support</li>
580	                <li>Open Graph meta tags</li>
581	            </ul>
582	            <button type="button" class="cta-button" id="learn-more-btn" aria-label="Learn more and contact us">Learn More</button>
583	        </article>
